# Generated by script/pin-metadata.mjs before each seed. Deliberately NOT
# committed: it carries ipfs:// URIs whose blocks live on whichever node did the
# pinning, so a shared manifest would resolve to `unreachable` for everyone
# else. Regenerate it instead — same catalogue bytes produce the same CIDs.
script/metadata-manifest.json
